  "referenceNumber": "SYR0423",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that the Sultan Suleiman Shah Division is an involved person under the Syria (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following grounds: the Sultan Suleiman Shah Division is or has been involved in repressing the civilian population in Syria. \n",
